`projectedBranchBudgetCut`'s doc comment used to say "Projection-aware variant of [estimateSessionBranchTokens]" (correct: the raw-branch tally it adjusts). The round-3 split renamed the referenced function, and the ref was mechanically updated to the new name:

```dart
/// Projection-aware variant of [estimateProjectedBranchTokens] (issue #503
